menu "Blockhaus"

    config BLOCKHAUS_FONT_MONO
        bool "JetBrains Mono font for identity typography"
        default y
        help
            When enabled, JetBrains Mono font glyphs are linked (adds ~60 KB
            to flash). Disable to save space if the identity component is used
            without the typography layer.

    config BLOCKHAUS_FONT_MONO_SIZE
        int "Main font size (px)"
        range 8 72
        default 40
        help
            Point size of the mono font used for the wordmark.
            Generated at build time; re-run font generation if changed.

endmenu